# Cadastral data and web services

The Government of Navarre provides the cadastral data and INSPIRE ATOM, WFS
and WMS services accessed by CatastRoNav through SITNA and IDENA.
The Government of Navarre (Gobierno de Navarra) is credited as a data
contributor (dtc) in Authors@R, with ROR identifier
<https://ror.org/025qq4838>. Its official INSPIRE page identifies it as the
producer of the harmonized cadastral parcel, building and address datasets.
Rights in individual resources, services and datasets belong to the holders
identified in their metadata.

The GPL-2 license for the package code does not replace the terms governing
access to and use of these data and services.

